A||||2||RICK||NOS on the 2.8
Z||000000||RICK||04-22-99||11:11 AM||||Has anybody put a nitrous system on the 2.8 fiero?  What type of mod's to the engine have you done before putting the kit on.  How many HP kit does anybody recommend?<br>thanks!
Z||000001||theogre||04-22-99||01:55 PM||||contact NOS Nitrous systems at  <A HREF="http://www.nosnitrous.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.nosnitrous.com</A>  They have systems for all types of setups, including basic stock engines with no modification.<p>One problem you will likely have is bottle placement. For best operation, and complete draining of the bottle, it needs to be setup in a particular way. Fiero's limited storage can make that a real pain.
Z||000002||Shaun41178||04-23-99||01:57 AM||||Rick<br>I have put nitrous on my 85 Gt with great success.  I purchased my kit from NOS but there are other kits out there that are just as good but are less expensive.  NitrousWorks for one.<p>I am running a 70 shot and the acceleration is incredible.  I have gotten to 60 in 6.1 secs.  Not bad for an auto tranny.  Starting to think of upping it to a 90 shot but only thinking for now.<p>No mods to the engine were done for me.  It is completely stock.<p>As far as mounting the bottle, I mounted mine in the trunk.  I drilled several holes and mounted the bottle with the supplied brackets.  Over the summer however I would like to move the bottle to the front compartment for better stealth.<p>The instructions supplied with my kit were very thorough.  If you would like to read about my nitrous installation, you can see it on my webpage at  http://members.aol.com/shaun41178<p>If you have any questions just email me or respond to this forum. Later
